NCE IS NOW A TEST rather than a paragraph - the suite asserts that this curve moves f_renal less than six percentage points across Holbrook's plausible span (38 to 115 mmol/day; presently 0.052), which is the whole reason a 28-subject balance study could report constancy without contradicting it. If anything ever steepens this exponent that assertion fires and the defence is gone with it. || ROUNDED 2026-09-09 TO MEASUREMENT PRECISION at the owner's instruction. Nothing physiological in this model is measured to more than four significant figures, and trailing zeros on a whole number read as precision that is not there. The discarded digits were floating-point residue from the derivation, not information. Directive 1.13.
"""
