surement behind it - the exemption pooling.md records, and the lesson CV.CO.NOMINAL wrote down. Rounding it to four figures put arterial PCO2 out by 1 part in 10,000, which the suite caught. The MEASUREMENT it descends from, RESP.METABOLIC_RATE, stays at the three figures its source reports. || ROUNDED 2026-09-09 TO MEASUREMENT PRECISION at the owner's instruction. Nothing physiological in this model is measured to more than four significant figures, and trailing zeros on a whole number read as precision that is not there. The discarded digits were floating-point residue from the derivation, not information. Directive 1.13.
