    :BF_H2O_CUTANEOUS_LOSS => Provenance("BF.H2O.CUTANEOUS_LOSS", "L/day", 0.5155, "C", "derived", "Derived as a residual. See notes.", "PINNED AS A RESIDUAL SO THE TOTAL IS UNCHANGED, exactly as RN.URINE.SOLUTE_NONNA is pinned so the mid salt arm returns its reference load. BF.H2O.INSENSIBLE_LOSS is 0.8 L/day; respiratory loss at the reference individual is 0.3120; this is 0.8 - 0.3120 = 0.4880. || WHY IT MUST BE EXACT. validation/respiratory_prereg.md section 6 forbids this change moving BF.H2O.INSENSIBLE_LOSS's value, because every ADH constant is derived from a water balance that closes at the reference individual. The resting state must be bit-identical and only the RESPONSE may move. check_closure.py asserts the identity. || WHAT CHANGED IS THE SPLIT, NOT THE TOTAL, AND THE SPLIT IS THE RESULT. BF.H2O.INSENSIBLE_LOSS is assumed and cited 'Convention pending primary source.' 39 percent of it is now computed from physical constants and a sourced chemoreflex rather than assumed, and the 0.4880 L/day left over is a plausible cutaneous loss - the conventional split, reached without being aimed at. || IT IS STILL A RESIDUAL AND NOT A MEASUREMENT. Sourcing transepidermal water loss directly would make this row reported and turn the identity above into a TEST of the respiratory half rather than a definition of the cutaneous half. That is the next step on the water side. || EXTENSIVE. || RE-DERIVED 2026-09-05, 0.4880 -> 0.5155 L/day. It is the residual of BF.H2O.INSENSIBLE_LOSS after the respiratory flux, and the respiratory flux fell with the sourced CO2 production. THE TOTAL IS UNCHANGED, so every downstream water and sodium quantity - extracellular volume, plasma sodium, arterial pressure - is bit-identical. The split moved; the balance did not. || The respiratory share is now 36 percent of insensible loss rather than 39. || PRECISION RAISED 2026-09-05: this is a DERIVED row closing an identity, so it carries every digit the arithmetic gives rather than the significant figures of the measurement behind it - the exemption pooling.md records, and the lesson CV.CO.NOMINAL wrote down. Rounding it to four figures put arterial PCO2 out by 1 part in 10,000, which the suite caught. The MEASUREMENT it descends from, RESP.METABOLIC_RATE, stays at the three figures its source reports. || ROUNDED 2026-09-09 TO MEASUREMENT PRECISION at the owner's instruction. Nothing physiological in this model is measured to more than four significant figures, and trailing zeros on a whole number read as precision that is not there. The discarded digits were floating-point residue from the derivation, not information. Directive 1.13."),
    :BF_H2O_INSENSIBLE_LOSS => Provenance("BF.H2O.INSENSIBLE_LOSS", "L/day", 0.8, "B", "assumed", "Convention pending primary source.", "ASSUMED. Respiratory plus transepidermal, sedentary thermoneutral adult. Needs a primary source; varies strongly with ambient conditions and activity, so a single constant is a known simplification."),
